  "Question": "Which of the following properties does a rhombus have that a general parallelogram does not necessarily have?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Opposite sides are parallel",
    "B": "Opposite angles are equal",
    "C": "The diagonals bisect each other",
    "D": "The diagonals are perpendicular to each other"
