  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Parallel opposite sides, equal opposite angles, and diagonals that bisect each other are common properties of parallelograms. Perpendicular diagonals are a property specific to rhombuses.",
